{"total_count":241,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/langchain/commits/1aa4496fb4ec1a18973ddaa5925dcadc2fdd9f4f","sha":"1aa4496fb4ec1a18973ddaa5925dcadc2fdd9f4f","node_id":"MDY6Q29tbWl0NTUyNjYxMTQyOjFhYTQ0OTZmYjRlYzFhMTg5NzNkZGFhNTkyNWRjYWRjMmZkZDlmNGY=","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/commit/1aa4496fb4ec1a18973ddaa5925dcadc2fdd9f4f","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/langchain/commits/1aa4496fb4ec1a18973ddaa5925dcadc2fdd9f4f/comments","commit":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/langchain/git/commits/1aa4496fb4ec1a18973ddaa5925dcadc2fdd9f4f","author":{"date":"2026-05-21T12:08:54.000-04:00","name":"Nick Hollon","email":"nick.hollon@langchain.dev"},"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T12:08:54.000-04:00","name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com"},"message":"feat(langchain): register stream transformers on middleware (#37591)\n\nAdds a `transformers` attribute to `AgentMiddleware` so middleware can\ndeclare scope-aware `StreamTransformer` factories alongside their\n`tools` and lifecycle hooks. `create_agent` merges middleware-registered\nfactories with any caller-supplied ones at compile time.\n\n## API\n\n```python\nclass MyMiddleware(AgentMiddleware):\n    transformers = (MyTransformer,)  # factory: (scope,) -> StreamTransformer\n```\n\nWhen the agent compiles, the final transformer order on the run mux is:\n\n1. Built-in ``ToolCallTransformer``\n2. Middleware-registered factories, in middleware order\n3. Caller-supplied ``transformers=`` from ``create_agent``\n\nThis ordering keeps the built-in tool-call projection in front of any\nconsumer transformers and gives caller-supplied entries the final word.","tree":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/langchain/git/trees/f86dcd2a80d884f602a5954a811570705a6b16a1","sha":"f86dcd2a80d884f602a5954a811570705a6b16a1"},"comment_count":0},"author":{"login":"nick-hollon-lc","id":274035459,"node_id":"U_kgDOEFVz